WEBVTT

00:00:28.696 --> 00:00:31.802
"Oradan ko'p yillar o'tgach, 
qatlga hukm etilgan polkovnik

00:00:31.802 --> 00:00:36.152
Aureliano Buendia o'zini otishlarini 
kutarkan, otasi muz bo'lagini ko'rsatishga

00:00:36.152 --> 00:00:40.203
olib borgan o'sha olis oqshomni eslaydi".
Keyingi o'n sakkiz oy

00:00:40.203 --> 00:00:42.028
ichidabu so'zlar ortidan

00:00:42.028 --> 00:00:46.317
"Yolg'izlikning yuz yili" 
asari dunyoga keladi.

00:00:46.317 --> 00:00:49.552
Bu Lotin Amerikasi adabiyotini 
dunyoga tanitgan va

00:00:49.552 --> 00:00:52.017
Garsiya Markesga 1982-yil 
Adabiyot bo'yicha

00:00:52.017 --> 00:00:57.214
Nobel mukofotini keltirgan 
roman hisoblanadi.

00:00:57.214 --> 00:01:00.862
"Yolg'izlikning yuz yili" nima uchun
bu qadar mashhur?